src/styles/glass/grasp.css:125 [above the --glass-veil-rung declaration (:135)] |        comes forward under the finger is the carrier's dilated optic below. A host that
src/styles/glass/grasp.css:126 [above the --glass-veil-rung declaration (:135)] |        paints no plate declares no floor and sheds the whole band.
src/styles/glass/grasp.css:127 [above the --glass-veil-rung declaration (:135)] | 
