src/styles/glass/grasp.css:196 [above the --glass-veil-rung declaration (:209)] |        register table.) The ink lerps across the same envelope and lands on
src/styles/glass/grasp.css:197 [above the --glass-veil-rung declaration (:209)] |        `--glass-veil-rest` — the SAME value the plate resolves once the carriers
